# Split commit destinations

This worktree stays on ports 5182 (marketplace) and 5183 (portal).

- Marketplace commits push to `origin`: `https://github.com/VenusChung26/Mattex-Marketplace-Storefront.git`, branch `mattex-marketplace-dev-2`.
- Portal commits push to `portal`: `https://github.com/VenusChung26/Mattex-Marketplace-Admin-Portal.git`, branch `mattex-marketplace-dev-2`.
- Do not push this worktree onto storefront `mattex-marketplace-dev-1` or admin `main`. Do not force-push.

Marketplace paths: buyer pages, `src/components` used by the shop, `vercel.json`, storefront build and prerender.

Portal paths: `src/pages/admin/**`, `vite.admin.config.js`, `vercel.admin.json`, `src/lib/adminCopy.js`.

Shared paths both deploys need (`api/`, `server/`, `src/lib` used by both, `src/App.jsx`, `package.json`) push to **both** remotes in the same commit.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD — portal page committed only to the storefront repo
git push origin HEAD

// ✅ GOOD — portal page goes to the admin repo; shared API goes to both
git push portal HEAD:mattex-marketplace-dev-2
git push origin HEAD
```
